WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: 1-15 - Safe Mode: The Gymnastic Mat
NOTE Artist: Crimson Node
NOTE Album: 2002: Crimson Node

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:47.000
[Massive Stadium Intro: Soaring Guitars, Heavy Gated Drums & Bright Synthesizers]

00:00:47.358 --> 00:00:55.500
The monitors are cooling and the routers slow their spin

00:00:55.600 --> 00:01:03.500
The final LAN connection brings the outer limits in

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:12.846
The canopy is quiet and the Admiral is fed

00:01:13.026 --> 00:01:18.500
We're leaving all the heavy wooden furniture behind

00:01:19.147 --> 00:01:27.591
The daily operations are suspended in the mind!

00:01:28.132 --> 00:01:36.500
We are entering the Safe Mode! The perimeter is clear!

00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:44.500
The physical foundation of the sanctuary's here!

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:52.800
We are dropping to the center where the gravity is flat

00:01:52.900 --> 00:02:00.500
We are gathered in the quiet on the gymnastic mat!

00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:07.619
Yeah, we are gathered in the quiet on the gymnastic mat!

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:35.800
[Beat Drops Out: Warm Pulsing Analog Bassline & Gentle Synthesizer Cooldown]

00:02:36.043 --> 00:02:44.500
The acoustic war is over, not a single sound to make

00:02:44.600 --> 00:02:52.500
The instigator settles and the stoic finds his place

00:02:52.600 --> 00:03:00.500
Seventy pounds of pressure resting heavy on the floor

00:03:00.600 --> 00:03:08.500
The riot squad is sleeping right inside the open door

00:03:08.600 --> 00:03:16.800
No variables to calculate, no firewall to run

00:03:16.900 --> 00:03:25.897
The architecture rests until we see the morning sun.

00:03:28.511 --> 00:03:37.500
The tactile language softens to a whisper in the dark

00:03:37.600 --> 00:03:47.106
A gentle double-tap to hold the center of the spark...

00:03:47.186 --> 00:03:56.000
We are resting in the Safe Mode, the perimeter is clear.

00:03:56.100 --> 00:04:04.500
The physical foundation of the sanctuary's here.

00:04:04.600 --> 00:04:12.500
We are dropping to the center where the gravity is flat.

00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:18.933
We are gathered in the quiet on the gymnastic mat.

00:04:25.837 --> 00:04:29.500
System powering down.

00:04:33.821 --> 00:04:38.024
The phalanx is resting.

00:04:38.124 --> 00:04:42.000
Safe Mode engaged.

00:04:42.500 --> 00:04:59.000
[Ambient Synthesizer Decay into Peaceful Silence]
